  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Explore this map",
      "items": [
        "Click a component to inspect its source evidence. Search, zoom, trace a route, or follow upstream/downstream dependencies.",
        "This is a source-backed system map, not a live execution monitor. Watch & run shows actual executions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Agent decisions",
      "items": [
        "Teams with a configured manager use CrewAI hierarchical delegation. The manager can adapt, skip, revisit and combine work using the available agents.",
        "One agent bypasses team management. Teams without a manager retain the sequential compatibility path. Skills guide decisions and never grant tools implicitly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deployment model",
      "items": [
        "Nginx terminates TLS; the AgentSim container is exposed only through host loopback. API, agents, tools and the image CLI run in the same container.",
        "SQLite, generated files and independent provider credentials persist in a server-mounted data directory. Login configuration is mounted separately.",
        "OpenAI and MCP access depends on configured accounts, available models and explicit per-agent permissions. This map does not claim those connections are currently active."
      ]
    }
  ]
